{"ref":"BDB, פִּתּוּחַ","hw":"פִּתּוּחַ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתּוּחַ</span></big>  <strong>n.m. engraving</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">2 Ch 2:13</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתֻּחָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.9\">Zc 3:9</a>; elsewhere pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתּוּחִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2 Ch 2:6</a>, etc.;—on (wood overlaid with) metal, <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתּוּחֵי מִקְלְעוֹת כְּרוּבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.29\">1 K 6:29</a> (see v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:21\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.22\">22</a>), in temple, so <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:6\" href=\"/Psalms.74.6\">ψ 74:6</a>; on stone <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 3:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.3.9\">Zc 3:9</a>, especially <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּתּוּחֵי חֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:11\" href=\"/Exodus.28.11\">Ex 28:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:21\" href=\"/Exodus.28.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:36\" href=\"/Exodus.28.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:6\" href=\"/Exodus.39.6\">39:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:14\" href=\"/Exodus.39.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:30\" href=\"/Exodus.39.30\">30</a>; in gen. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2 Ch 2:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">13</a>.","next":"BDB, פְּתִיגִיל","prev":"BDB, פָּתַח²"}